cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MitoCensus, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MitoCensus: object-level quality control for mitochondrial morphometry in volume electron microscopy"
abstract: "MitoCensus turns a volume electron microscopy stack and any aligned mitochondrial instance mask into an object-linked measurement record. Every label is traced to its source sections and checked before it is measured; excluded labels stay visible, edge bias from a finite crop can be corrected, and cohort statistics are computed by biological unit rather than by object."
